good afternoon i'm lieutenant ray  spencer i'm the homicide lieutenant with  the las vegas metropolitan police  department  i'm here this afternoon to brief you on  the homicide investigation that we have  been conducting for the last  10 days that occurred a week ago friday  in  mountain springs over  the last 10 days we have put in a  tremendous amount of resources  and effort in an attempt to identify the  victim of the homicide that occurred  i specifically want to thank a few  agencies  that has made this press conference  possible this afternoon  first off i'd like to thank the clark  county coroner's office they have been a  tremendous partner  and they have also worked tyrus  tirelessly  the last week and a half on this case  in addition i want to thank the san jose  police department  for the work that they have done to  assist us in identifying  the victim and lastly the work from the  forensics lab  who worked and came in over the weekend  to make an identification  possible so i will walk you through some  of the details that occurred  starting friday night so again all last  week we had detectives working  through hundreds of leads in an effort  to identify  the victim friday evening at around 8pm  i received a phone call  from a sergeant with the san jose police  department  who stated that they believed they had a  potential  victim of a missing person who they  believed  may have been our victim that point they  sent  photographs to me after looking at those  photographs  we believed that there was a very good  possibility  that the missing person case that they  were working in san jose was related to  our homicide investigation  the following morning saturday morning  we  did a lot of work up in investigative  techniques in an effort to positively  identify  and link the two cases that morning i  sent a detective to san jose california  they flew there they retrieved a  clothing and a pillow that belonged to  the missing  seven-year-old child in san jose that  detective flew back to las vegas a  couple hours later  and yesterday morning a scientist came  into the forensic lab and began working  on processing dna evidence  to confirm that the victim was in fact  the seven-year-old child  late last night we positively identified  the victim as seven-year-old liam  houstead l-i-a-m houstead h-u-s-t-e-d  he is a seven-year-old child who lives  in san jose california  what we have learned is that he has last  seen  in the san jose area on may 24th  so what occurred was a family friend  of the mother who is 35 year old  samantha  marino rodriguez the family  friend stated that she had not seen  samantha or liam  in over two weeks she also knew that  there was a missing or  that the two of them were missing she  saw  news coverage from our case here in las  vegas and saw the composite sketch  that was pushed out to the media after  seeing that  she believed that the sketch resembled  liam  she then went to the san jose police  department on friday  prompting the chain of events that i  outlined  so what we have learned from the two of  them  samantha and liam left san jose  california  driving a 19 i'm sorry a 2007  dark blue dodge caliber  they left san jose on the 24th of may  we can place them in the area of laguna  beach  on the afternoon of the 26th of may  later that afternoon we know the vehicle  was in the area of victorville  california  on late in the afternoon on the 26th of  may  liam was discovered early in the morning  on the 28th  of may shortly thereafter on the 29th of  may  we know that the vehicle was traveling  on i-70  near grand junction colorado  the last contact that anyone has seen  of samantha is at a denver area hotel  room  on the 31st of may when she checked in  by herself to a hotel room in the denver  area  at this point there is about an hour ago  we obtained an arrest warrant  nationwide extradition for open murder  for samantha marino rodriguez  i urge anyone we still need assistance  anyone who may have recognized her  and liam in the las vegas valley on the  27th or 28th of  may driving again the dark blue  dodge caliber we understand that the  vehicle  was packed full of belongings and when i  say packed i believe that the back seat  and cargo compartment of the car had no  room for anyone to sit  and it was packed completely we are  asking anyone who works at a hotel or a  motel in the las vegas valley to please  check their hotel register  for the days of the 27th and 28th  to see if samantha checked into a hotel  here in the las vegas valley  you can also if that is the if you have  that information you can reach out to  crime stoppers  or you can call the homicide tip line at  702-828-3521  so again there's a lot of moving parts  to this investigation it is still  extremely active and ongoing  the fbi local office here in their  national  national field offices are assisting us  at this point  in attempting to apprehend samantha  with that i will take a couple questions  what do you know about  rodriguez what have you learned again  she's a  35 year old woman who lives in the san  jose area  and again that she is the mother of  seven-year-old liam  we know again she left on the 24th and  that's  what prompted this investigation in the  back was there ever a sign of  did they talk about a relationship or a  history of abuse or anything  there's nothing at this point that would  indicate there's any prior  abuse that we're aware of again it's  still a lot of moving parts and still  very active  but nothing that has been brought to our  attention at this point do you know  anything about why they left san jose  we don't know the specifics we're still  trying to find out we're still  interviewing family and friends  trying to piece all that together any  possible motive  we don't know a possible motive that's  why we're still  reaching out we're still asking for the  public's assistance or anybody who knows  her  to reach out to us or anyone who's had  any communication specifically  to reach out to the police department i  just have a follow-up did you have to  break the news to this child's parents  that  this was his body and can you kind of  talk about that  the clark county coroner specifically  made the death notification  i spoke with the father about 60 minutes  ago before i came out here  because i didn't want him to see this  press conference without me explaining  what was about to transpire  i will tell you it's a heartbreaking  conversation to have  this has been an emotional last 10 days  for myself  all the investigators that have been  working on it and we're just glad we're  able to get some closure for liam  and then hold the person responsible for  this crime accountable so that's  what our focus is right now yes any  connection to las vegas with the two  that you know we don't know i mean we do  know that samantha has visited las vegas  in the past there's been photographs  that we have recovered that does show  that she's been here previously  but as far as why she was in the las  vegas valley that day we don't know  yes  at this point we believe from the  information that we have obtained at  this point we believe she is traveling  alone  and she was last seen alone in the  denver area on the 31st  do you know anything about the  relationship between her and the boy's  father  i'm not going to get into the specifics  of that on  that portion of it i don't know enough  about the family dynamics so liam wasn't  officially declared a missing person  until friday right  were there any indications that they  were trying to get a hold of them on the  days prior  so the father had made a report on the  first  but the father did not feel that his son  was in harm's way when the mother left  with the child  he did contact the police because he had  not heard from her or  his son again not trying to get the  mother into trouble he didn't want to  file any type of charges or anything but  he did contact  the police on the first and just to be  clear he is  not a suspect and there is no  involvement whatsoever  that we suspect on his behalf  in the back thank you i appreciate it
 

